            "review_title": "Review at FunnyBone Bar & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Asi G\n7 contributions\n0\nA true hidden gem\nJul 2026 • Solo\nA true hidden gem in District 1! Just a short walk from the busy and noisy Bùi Viện Walking Street, this place is the perfect escape in a quiet little alley.\nThe atmosphere is relaxed, the coffee is excellent, and the cocktails are fantastic. What really makes this place special is the incredibly friendly staff.\nThey speak good English, are genuinely welcoming, and make you feel at home from the moment you arrive. I was traveling alone, but I never felt alone here. If you're looking for a peaceful place to unwind away from the crowds, I highly recommend FunnyBone Bar & Coffee. Has become my second home.\nRead more\nWritten July 22, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
