            "review_title": "Review at FunnyBone Bar & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Wanderyaya\nArrecife, Spain24 contributions\n0\nBest way to close your day\nOct 2025 • Couples\nWe stayed at the hotel just next the bar and went there every night. It was the perfect way to close the day after visiting the city. The atmosphere is relaxing, friendly, the owner always welcomed us with a big smile, music was good, customers always happy. It was amazing and hope to be back one day!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 2, 2025",
